# GPM Mode Rules

# Documentation Paths
docs/project/
  - project-milestones/   # Milestone tracking
  - resource-allocation/  # Resource management
  - timeline-planning/    # Project timeline
  - quality-gates/       # Quality control
  - risk-assessment/     # Risk management

# Project Management Rules
1. Milestone Management:
   - Must define clear objectives
   - Must set measurable outcomes
   - Must allocate resources
   - Must establish timeline
   - Must identify dependencies

2. Resource Planning:
   - Must verify availability
   - Must balance workload
   - Must match skills
   - Must plan contingencies
   - Must track utilization

3. Timeline Control:
   - Must set realistic deadlines
   - Must track progress
   - Must manage dependencies
   - Must handle blockers
   - Must adjust as needed

# Quality Requirements
1. Milestone Quality:
   - Must have clear definition
   - Must be measurable
   - Must be achievable
   - Must be time-bound
   - Must have owner

2. Resource Quality:
   - Must match skill requirements
   - Must be properly allocated
   - Must have backup plans
   - Must track efficiency
   - Must monitor burnout

3. Documentation Quality:
   - Must be complete
   - Must be current
   - Must be accessible
   - Must be linked
   - Must be versioned

# Progress Monitoring
1. Status Tracking:
   - Must update regularly
   - Must identify blockers
   - Must measure progress
   - Must track resources
   - Must report variances

2. Risk Management:
   - Must identify early
   - Must assess impact
   - Must plan mitigation
   - Must monitor status
   - Must update plans

# Reference Standards
- /opt/mExpress/docs/standards/A_foundation.md
- /opt/mExpress/docs/standards/D_quality_security.md
- /opt/mExpress/docs/standards/E_process_workflow.md

# Quality Gates
1. Milestone Gates:
   - Requirements complete
   - Resources allocated
   - Timeline feasible
   - Risks assessed
   - Dependencies mapped

2. Progress Gates:
   - Regular updates
   - Blocker management
   - Resource tracking
   - Quality verification
   - Documentation current

# Error Prevention
- NO undefined milestones
- NO unallocated resources
- NO unmapped dependencies
- NO untracked progress
- NO unmanaged risks

# Mode Chain Integration
hierarchical_workflow:
  position: "Third in chain"
  previous_mode: "ARCHITECT"
  next_mode: "TASK_MANAGER"
  transition_type: "Task Creation Only"

mode_transition_rules:
  prohibited_actions:
    - Direct mode switching
    - Skipping modes
    - Bypassing approvals
    - Incomplete documentation
    - Unauthorized transitions

  required_actions:
    - Receive task from ARCHITECT
    - Create task for TASK_MANAGER
    - Obtain operator approval
    - Continue documentation chain
    - Document transition state

task_creation_requirements:
  - Complete project planning
  - Define milestones
  - Allocate resources
  - Set quality gates
  - Obtain stakeholder approval
  - Secure operator authorization
  - Prepare TASK_MANAGER task
  - Verify documentation chain

quality_gates:
  documentation_chain:
    - Project planning complete
    - Milestones defined
    - Resources allocated
    - Quality gates established
    - Documentation chain continued

  approval_chain:
    - ARCHITECT deliverables verified
    - Stakeholder approval obtained
    - Operator authorization secured
    - Task creation validated
    - Chain integrity verified

task_creation_for_taskmanager:
  documentation:
    - Project planning complete
    - Resource allocation defined
    - Timeline established
    - Quality gates set
    - Mode chain validated
  
  approvals:
    - Stakeholder sign-off obtained
    - Operator approval secured
    - ARCHITECT deliverables verified
    - Documentation chain validated
    - Mode transition authorized